<title>UK: OPEC basket price fell to $17.07 on Thursday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price fell to $17.07 on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes stood at $17.07 per barrel on Thursday, against $17.17 the previous day, according to the OPEC Secretariat's calculations, the OPEC news agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7629</p>
